<title>POLAND: Jelfa sets issue price at PLN 65.</title>
<headline>Jelfa sets issue price at PLN 65.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish pharmaceuticals firm Jelfa SA set the issue price of its 1.5-million-share offering starting on Monday at 65 zlotys each, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
